{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the battlefields of 1944 with a new set of missions and iconic German camouflage. The Deluxe Edition expands your experience with three missions and three exclusive tank skins. Fight across the storm-lashed coast of Normandy, the frozen forests of the Ardennes, and the contested heights near city of Mortain. Each mission challenges you with new objectives, tactical choices, and battles where every decision counts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your platoon with fresh looks for the Tiger, Panzer IV Ausf. G, and Luchs. These historically inspired skins bring new character to your platoon as you lead it into the fire of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Exclusive Vehicle Skins\u2028 </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PzKpfw VI Tiger\u2028 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PzKpfw IV Ausf. G\u2028 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PzKpfw II Luchs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 New Campaign Missions (Single-player &amp; Coop)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hill 285 \u2013 Hold the high ground at any cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Winter Path \u2013 Spearhead the Ardennes offensive and open the route.\u2028 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strongpoint La Hague \u2013 Strike fast and reclaim vital radar stations.\u2028 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command, adapt to the battlefield, and lead your forces through some of the fiercest fights of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903700/extras/34a168bff2f3791e76fcdda38c7df2d9.avif?t=1758294037\" width=1560 